  "description": "<p>Show your solidarity and support for all military personnel serving with our R.E.D. (Remember Everyone Deployed) T-Shirt with Solid Blue Flag. This patriotic shirt features a graphic design on the front chest that honors deployed service members, along with a reverse distressed American Flag on the right sleeve. Reliable and Long-Lasting: The breathable cotton fabric withstands strenuous activities while remaining soft and comfortable. These graphic t-shirts feature a ribbed collar, tag-less neck label, and reinforced seams at the sleeves and bottom hem. Standard Fit: The short sleeve military shirt is designed with a standard fit, giving you room and flexibility for any activity. The crew neck shirt sits approximately at the waist for full coverage and comfort. Land of the Free: Whether you&rsquo;re out on a weekend trip or casually walking around town, these comfortable shirts are great for outdoor adventures, everyday use, and more. Our Remember Everyone Deployed Shirts are perfect for showcasing your American spirit during Memorial Day, Veterans Day, and Red Fridays. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Pair your patriotic tee with one of our Tactical BDU Cargo Pants or Vintage Paratrooper Cargo Shorts.</p>",
